{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6104","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6104/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6104/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6104/events","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6104","id":1617887277,"node_id":"I_kwDOAacf885gbwAt","number":6104,"title":"xdsclient: flush any unsent loads when the LRS stream is closed","user":{"login":"easwars","id":1638487,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mzg0ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1638487?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars","html_url":"https://github.com/easwars","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":528927681,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1Mjg5Mjc2ODE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/labels/P2","name":"P2","color":"610B0B","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":586671344,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODY2NzEzNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/labels/Type:%20Bug","name":"Type: Bug","color":"bfdadc","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7326492378,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAacf888AAAABtLFm2g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/labels/Area:%20xDS","name":"Area: xDS","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Includes everything xDS related, including LB policies used with xDS.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":12,"created_at":"2023-03-09T19:38:51Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:42:34Z","closed_at":"2025-12-16T17:28:29Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":"resolved","sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The LRS implementation in the xDS client transport can be found here: https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/blob/55d8783479c7cc1a72a435340432702a67d809aa/xds/internal/xdsclient/transport/loadreport.go#L47\r\n\r\nThe `ReportLoad()` API returns a cancel func which is plumbed all the way to the user of the `XDSClient` API here: https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/blob/55d8783479c7cc1a72a435340432702a67d809aa/xds/internal/xdsclient/client.go#L56\r\n\r\nThe current implementation of this cancel function simply cancels the context passed to the LRS stream, which results in the stream getting closed. But what we really want is for unsent loads to be flushed on the stream before it is closed.\r\n\r\nThe xDS client transport spawns the `lrsRunner` goroutine https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/blob/55d8783479c7cc1a72a435340432702a67d809aa/xds/internal/xdsclient/transport/loadreport.go#L95 which (in a backoff loop) sends the first LRS request, receives the first response and then calls `sendLoads` to periodically send out load reports https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/blob/55d8783479c7cc1a72a435340432702a67d809aa/xds/internal/xdsclient/transport/loadreport.go#L153\r\n\r\nWhat we want is for the cancel function to synchronize with `sendLoads` so that when the cancel function is invoked, it results in unsent loads being flushed before the stream context is cancelled.","closed_by":{"login":"easwars","id":1638487,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mzg0ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1638487?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars","html_url":"https://github.com/easwars","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6104/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6104/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}